---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto p-6 mt-12 mb-24">
    <div class="text-mono-sm tracking-system mb-4">OUTRIGHT / ABOUT</div>
    <h1 class="text-hero mb-12">MANIFESTO</h1>

    <div class="receipt-rule mb-12"></div>

    <article class="text-mono leading-relaxed space-y-8 text-lg">
      <p>
        WE BELIEVE THE DIGITAL RETAIL EXPERIENCE HAS BECOME STAGNANT.
        ROWS OF ROUNDED CARDS. DROPSHADOWS. GENERIC SAAS AESTHETICS.
      </p>
      
      <p>
        THIS IS AN EXPERIMENT IN DIGITAL BRUTALISM AND SPATIAL COMMERCE.
      </p>

      <p>
        WE TREAT THE BROWSER AS A PHYSICAL MACHINE.
        THE CATALOG IS A SPATIAL ENVIRONMENT.
        THE INTERFACE IS PRINTED ON THERMAL RECEIPT PAPER.
      </p>

      <p>
        NO DECORATION.
        NO MARKETING COPY.
        ONLY THE PRODUCT AND The TRANSACTION.
      </p>

      <div class="receipt-rule my-12"></div>

      <div class="text-sm">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[var(--ink-faded)] mb-1">LOCATION</div>
            <div>GLOBAL NETWORK</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-[var(--ink-faded)] mb-1">SYSTEM</div>
            <div>ASTRO / R3F</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-[var(--ink-faded)] mb-1">DATE</div>
            <div>09.2026</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-[var(--ink-faded)] mb-1">STATUS</div>
            <div>OPERATIONAL</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
